    {
      "id": "evidence-000-notes",
      "kind": {
        "text": "Ran 2026-08-14: the file asserts the NEGATION of formal.statement and the solver reported `sat` with `kind=sat-model certified=1 arena=ok`. `arena=ok` is Evidence::check replaying the model against a fresh parse of the file -- the model is evaluated against the original assertions, not against the lowered form. The witness is p := false, q := true: then (p implies q) is true and q is true while p is false. Independently cross-checked: `z3 -smt2` on the same file also reports `sat`.",
